# Copy the files that match the process you run:
#   web/.env.example  ->  web/.env.local
#   api/.env.example  ->  api/.env  (optional; CORS has local defaults)
#
# Required for the Next.js app:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL          (login / save / investigations)
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL               (Analyze / Rules — public FastAPI origin)
#
# If NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is missing, the UI errors honestly (no mock detector).
# Vercel: Root Directory = web. See docs/vercel.md.
#
# Do not put SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in the web app.
